<title>USA: Pittsburgh sets Dec 4 for $300 mln bond deal.</title>
<headline>Pittsburgh sets Dec 4 for $300 mln bond deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pittsburgh plans to sell $300 million of bonds by competitive bids on Dec 4, the city's financial adviser said Friday.</p>
<p>An official with Grant Street Advisors said the deal will include a refunding component and a taxable pension component.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
